message: 'If you use this software, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'Shoulder: a Markdown editor with tracked changes and reasons for edits'
abstract: >-
  A Markdown editor with Word-style tracked changes and comments, built on a
  sentence-level model that records every edit and its reason. Runs in a
  browser or as a Mac app.
authors:
